00:02:37.704 --> 00:02:44.424
<v Slow>祇園祭は、京都の八坂神社のお祭りです。

00:02:45.223 --> 00:02:49.448
<v Host>The Gion Festival is a festival of the Yasaka Shrine in Kyoto.

00:02:50.048 --> 00:02:52.280
<v Vocab>神社

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:56.183
<v Host>A Shinto shrine, a place to worship the gods.

00:02:56.783 --> 00:03:02.448
<v Slow>日本で一番有名なお祭りの一つです。

00:03:03.247 --> 00:03:06.439
